<title>UK: Building sector leaders disappointed by UK budget.</title>
<headline>Building sector leaders disappointed by UK budget.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK construction industry chiefs slammed the Chancellor of the Exchequer's budget as &quot;another disappointment&quot; on Tuesday and said the cocktail of tax cuts and rises in some spending areas raised fears of higher interest rates.</p>
<p>The Building Employers Confederation, embracing some of the UK's top construction companies, told Reuters &quot;It's another disappointment for construction, especially given the economic backdrop.&quot;</p>
</text>
